\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The knowledge graph $K_G$. Nodes are the 21 BRFSS features in four role bands; edges assert guideline-recognised intervention routes, with line style encoding the ADA evidence grade. One arrow is drawn per distinct source--target pair, at the strongest grade asserting it, so the 26 edges appear as 21 arrows. No edge originates in the indicator band: indicators are sinks. The eight edges that terminate there are exactly the eight supported by section narrative rather than by a numbered recommendation. The immutable band is disconnected, lying on no intervention route.}}{6}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:kg}{{1}{6}{The knowledge graph $K_G$. Nodes are the 21 BRFSS features in four role bands; edges assert guideline-recognised intervention routes, with line style encoding the ADA evidence grade. One arrow is drawn per distinct source--target pair, at the strongest grade asserting it, so the 26 edges appear as 21 arrows. No edge originates in the indicator band: indicators are sinks. The eight edges that terminate there are exactly the eight supported by section narrative rather than by a numbered recommendation. The immutable band is disconnected, lying on no intervention route}{figure.1}{}}
